        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"d58b74e7-bc8c-469c-9c08-b87ed4c18062\",\"review_text\":\"Not sure if you have a great summer.\"},{\"review_id\":\"3b7b1c27-d82f-4b64-8087-5cffc494ef84\",\"review_text\":\"Best ever\"},{\"review_id\":\"4cedcf82-5ebe-4381-b43d-486c58485e76\",\"review_text\":\"It was a great app to listen music to but since the last few days it's been a horrible experience on this app . I can't even log into my account it keeps showing the password combination is incorrect even when it's not . So disappointing.\"},{\"review_id\":\"ec90f200-58f4-43e4-bb82-48c32c345772\",\"review_text\":\"Baaaaaad\"},{\"review_id\":\"2b8534f4-0774-4b9b-89af-cc276d9714c3\",\"review_text\":\"Too much ad and not proper functioning I have heard 5 ads in a row 😔👎👎 hungry for money !!!!👎👎😡🤬 do one thing disable the app. You guys want premium only then do one thing disable all the options and unlock it when u buy premium for changing songs also these 🤬 app wants premium. Any other music listening app is better than spotify.\"},{\"review_id\":\"6626456c-1973-4824-a9be-5982593408a8\",\"review_text\":\"Even scanner is not available for desktop to scan from mobile login\"},{\"review_id\":\"dd65c311-4466-4ac3-8f38-123de93f1523\",\"review_text\":\"Content horribly good, im a slave.. Thanks for bringing car play back.. any chance of making it work in landscape!?\"},{\"review_id\":\"d6686096-95ff-4bae-81e6-2688e59e5507\",\"review_text\":\"Good i like this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"73853aa3-70a8-44e6-82ef-d44ae9a34bda\",\"review_text\":\"Even when you turn off marketing push notifications, the app still pesters you from time to time to buy certain things like a 'family subscription'. It's very irritating.\"},{\"review_id\":\"03eb2ccb-a537-474c-99f2-76478c7db401\",\"review_text\":\"Lol app\"}]}"
